@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_BEARER_TOKEN
@cursor = REPLACE_WITH_RESPONSE_NEXT_CURSOR
@notificationId = REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_ID

### First page (USER/LEADER ACTIVE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/invitations?type=ALL&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same filter/limit/account required
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/invitations?type=ALL&limit=20&cursor={{cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Existing notification list and badge
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
